sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Guest
  participant Website as Hotel website / approved channel
  participant Core as Worthkind Flow booking coordinator
  participant PMS as Authorized hotel PMS
  participant PSP as Authorized payment provider
  participant DB as Domain state / audit / outbox
  participant Staff as Hotel reception / finance
  Guest->>Website: Dates, guests and room preference
  Website->>Core: scoped availability request
  alt No authorized PMS connected
    Core->>DB: Record enquiry, not booking
    Core-->>Guest: Enquiry queued for hotel staff
    Staff->>DB: Claim and respond
  else PMS connected
    Core->>PMS: Availability and tax-inclusive quote
    PMS-->>Core: Provider source quote, policy, expiry
    Core-->>Guest: Show terms, total and cancellation policy
    Guest->>Core: Explicitly approve checkout
    Core->>PMS: Hold inventory if supported
    Core->>DB: Idempotent payment intent and audit
    Core->>PSP: Secure hosted checkout
    PSP-->>Guest: Payment UX
    PSP->>Core: Signed webhook (may duplicate/out-of-order)
    Core->>PSP: Server-to-server verify amount/currency/reference
    alt Payment verified and PMS confirms
      Core->>PMS: Idempotent final reservation confirmation
      PMS-->>Core: Authoritative reservation reference
      Core->>DB: Commit confirmed booking and receipt outbox
      Core-->>Guest: Confirmed reference
    else Unknown, late or failed outcome
      Core->>DB: Exception and safe reconciliation workflow
      Staff->>DB: Finance/reception review, refund or recovery policy
      Core-->>Guest: Pending resolution, no false confirmation
    end
  end
